{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13722","headline":"酬房杭州 · 顾况","name":"酬房杭州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡楼何其旷，亭亭广而深。\n故人牧余杭，留我披胸衿。\n满箧阅新作，璧玉诞清音。\n流水入洞天，窅豁欲淩临。\n辟险延北阜，薙道陟南岑。\n朝从山寺还，醒醉动笑吟。\n荷花十余里，月色攒湖林。\n父老惜使君，却欲速华簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}